@startuml addressing
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
title Agreed desktop interaction — query, choose, re-resolve, act
actor User
participant "ModalAnyware\nMachine client" as Client
participant "Koine\nGraphQL + authorization" as Koine
participant "Desktop provider\nSwift dylib" as Desktop
Client -> Client: capture process identity at interaction start
Client -> Koine: desktopApplication(process)\nselect name and windows { ref title observation }
Koine -> Koine: authenticate; check desktop:read
Koine -> Desktop: resolve captured process; enumerate windows
Desktop --> Koine: current / remembered rows + opaque references
Koine --> Client: selected GraphQL data / explicit errors
Client -> Client: derive choices from data
Client --> User: present choices
User -> Client: choose a window
Client -> Koine: mutation desktopFocusWindow(ref)
Koine -> Koine: authorize all selected actions\nthen recheck grant at dispatch admission
Koine -> Desktop: focus the unchanged reference
Desktop -> Desktop: re-resolve identity; check OS permission
alt target still identifiable
Desktop -> Desktop: native focus / raise
Desktop --> Koine: receipt or native failure
else closed, stale or ambiguous
Desktop --> Koine: unavailable
end
Koine --> Client: receipt / error with response path
note over Client,Desktop
A reference is an opaque koine:// URI.
The engine has no graph cache and retries nothing.
Remembered display data is not proof of a live target.
A lost mutation response does not establish failure.
end note
@enduml
